  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Experience the Ultimate in All-Inclusive Luxury</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Welcome aboard the&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Chubby Mermaid</strong>, where we redefine what a luxury charter experience can be. Imagine stepping aboard without a care&mdash;everything you need for an unforgettable day on the water is already taken care of. From the moment you arrive to the moment you disembark, we ensure every detail is handled, so all you need to do is relax and enjoy.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">What Sets Us Apart:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Fully Stocked &amp; Always Included (at no extra charge!):</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Champagne &amp; macarons for a celebratory toast.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Craft cocktails, charcuterie boards, and frozen drinks prepared to your taste.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">A gourmet lunch and a selection of beverages, including wine, beer, and non-alcoholic options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Endless Entertainment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Inflatable water toys, snorkel gear, and a dinghy for exploring hidden spots.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">A curated playlist to set the perfect mood or connect your own music for a custom vibe.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Comfort at Every Turn:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Beach setup, including a shaded tent, chairs, a table, and a portable speaker for shore excursions.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Plush towels, premium sunscreen, and custom koozies for a carefree day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Exceptional Service:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">A licensed captain and dedicated crew to cater to your every need.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Personalized touches, from the welcome greeting to the final farewell.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Destinations You&rsquo;ll Love:</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Discover the beauty of Florida&rsquo;s Gulf Coast with charters to Anna Maria Island, Egmont Key, Passage Key, Jewfish Key, Sarasota, and Bradenton. Stop at local favorites like Waterside Restaurant, Pier 22, and River House, or enjoy secluded beaches and crystal-clear waters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Your Perfect Day Awaits:</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Whether you&rsquo;re celebrating a special occasion, entertaining guests, or just craving a day of relaxation and adventure, we provide the perfect all-inclusive experience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Book Now:</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;\">Spaces fill up fast&mdash;reserve your all-inclusive luxury charter today and discover why we&rsquo;re more than just a boat ride.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>Affiliate Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: Nunito, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Commission payments are disbursed within 7 days of completed charters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
